ent-WeaponFlareGun = 信號槍 | flare gun
    .desc = 一款體積小巧、單發式的手槍，可發射霰彈。配備安全裝置，可防止使用者裝入致命彈藥。 | A compact, single-shot pistol that fires shotgun shells. Comes with a safety feature that prevents the user from fitting lethal shells inside.
ent-WeaponFlareGunSecurity = 安全殼式槍械 | security shell gun
    .desc = 這是一款經過改良的信號槍，最初是為安保人員設計，用於發射非致命性霰彈；然而，它也能在毫無風險的情況下發射致命性彈藥。 | A modified flare gun originally designed to be used by security to launch non-lethal shotgun shells, however it can also fire lethal shells without risk.
